     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet dysphagia-severity-type-vs</b></p><a name=\"dysphagia-severity-type-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcdysphagia-severity-type-vs\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-dysphagia-scales-temp.html\"><code>https://sefatuncer.github.io/stroke-dysphagia-fhir-ig/CodeSystem/dysphagia-scales-temp</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?1.3.1</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-dysphagia-scales-temp.html#dysphagia-scales-temp-FOIS\">FOIS</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Functional Oral Intake Scale — level 1–7</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/767131006\">767131006</a></td><td>Dysphagia Outcome and Severity Scale</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/1231505003\">1231505003</a></td><td>International Dysphagia Diet Standardisation Initiative Functional Diet Scale</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
